# 2️⃣ MIDDLE PANEL — Chat Conversation (Most Important)

Right now it's empty. This area must become **powerful**.

### Message Types Support

WhatsApp supports:

* Text
* Image
* Video
* Document
* Audio
* Location
* Template messages
* Interactive buttons

So your UI must support **all message types**.

Example:

```
[text bubble]

[image preview]

[file card]
Invoice.pdf
Download
```

---

### Message Status

Add WhatsApp status.

```
✓ sent
✓✓ delivered
✓✓ blue read
```

---

### Timestamp grouping

```
Today
Yesterday
Jan 27
```

---

### Quick Reply Shortcuts

Agents should press `/` to send quick replies.

Example:

```
/price
/payment
/demo
/location
```

---

### Attachments

Your input bar should support:

```
📎 Attach
🖼 Image
📄 Document
🎤 Voice
🙂 Emoji
```

---

### Template Message Send

Needed for **24h window closed case**.

Example:

```
Send Template
↓
Order Update
Payment Reminder
Demo Confirmation
```

---

### Typing Indicator

Show:

```
Customer typing...
Agent typing...
```

---

### Message Reactions (optional but nice)

👍 ❤️

